   "title": "The Imperial galaxy",
   "date": "19–2 BBY",
   "view": "galaxy",
   "text": "For the first time in history one government rules the whole map: Moffs over sectors, Grand Moffs over oversectors, a navy of Star Destroyers and a Death Star under construction over Geonosis. Kashyyyk and Kessel are labour camps; Lothal is a factory; Mandalore is occupied. Hutt space and the Corporate Sector are tolerated — for now.",
