   "title": "The Rebellion",
   "date": "2–0 BBY",
   "view": {
    "focus": "Yavin",
    "w": 3000
   },
   "text": "The Corellian Treaty binds the resistance cells into an Alliance to Restore the Republic — Mon Mothma's politics, Bail Organa's money, Rebel cells on Lothal, Ryloth and Dantooine. The Death Star plans are stolen at Scarif, Alderaan is destroyed for it, and the station dies over Yavin.",
