    "w": 2800
   },
   "text": "The Alliance fleet gathers at Sullust and strikes the second Death Star over Endor's forest moon. The Emperor and Vader die; the Empire does not, but its centre is gone. Within a year the Alliance is the New Republic and Bakura is the first world it saves from something worse.",
